exports[`git.branch.catchup continue given: [case34] a settled merge in flight, a corrupt quota, and no sponsor when: [t0] continue then: matches snapshot 1`] = `
"🐢 bummer dude...

🐚 git.branch.catchup continue
   └─ 💥 MalfunctionError: commit quota file corrupt

   the file that holds this tree's commit quota cannot be read:
     .meter/git.commit.uses.jsonc

ask your human to reset the quota, then grant again:
  $ git.commit.uses del
  $ git.commit.uses set --quant N --push allow|block
"
`;

exports[`git.branch.catchup continue given: [case35] a settled merge in flight, and no sponsor when: [t0] continue then: matches snapshot 1`] = `
"🐢 bummer dude...

🐚 git.branch.catchup continue
   └─ ✋ ConstraintError: no sponsor for this commit

   no sponsor is bound to this tree, and this machine's git config
   names a clone:
     seaturtle[bot] <seaturtle@ehmpath.com>
   ...so this is the clone's machine, and it cannot answer for the change.

   ⛔ you cannot fix this yourself. a sponsor is bound by a human,
      at a terminal.

ask your human to run, in this tree:
  $ printf 'Name <email>' | rhx git.commit.sponsor set --who @stdin
  $ rhx git.commit.sponsor set --who "Name <email>"
"
`;

exports[`git.branch.catchup continue given: [case36] a settled merge in flight, and a human blocked the org when: [t0] continue then: matches snapshot 1`] = `
"🐢 bummer dude...

🐚 git.branch.catchup continue
   └─ ✋ ConstraintError: commits blocked for org ehmpathy

ask your human to allow:
  $ git.commit.uses allow --org <org>
"
`;

